and one of those brains was in its butt. I do remember this now that you mention it, like a walnut-sized brain in his butt. But why did he think this? So he noticed that the neural canal running through the sacrum, which is the fused vertebra at the hip, widened into a large empty cavity in its bottom half that no one could explain.
